    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MAS202 · Material pack</span>\n<h2>The student material pack</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">21 pptx. Slides are shown in the lessons above; the other files are downloaded inside FLM with your FPT account.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MAS202 · Gói tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Gói tài liệu sinh viên</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">21 pptx. Slide đã gắn vào các bài phía trên; các tệp khác tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT.</p></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>File<br><small>Tệp</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Size<br><small>Dung lượng</small></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch00.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch01.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch02.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>5.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch03.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch04.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.5 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch05.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch06.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>3.2 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch07.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.5 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch08.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch09.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch10.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch11.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch12.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch13.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch14.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>3.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch15.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>3.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch16.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>4.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch17.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>5.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch18.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch19.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>9781292265148_Berenson_BBS_GE_PPT/bbs14e_ppt_ch20.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.5 MB</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>"
